==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.14.0|
* The stats which limit the total rate of recovery per second from leech have been changed. Previously these limited any recovery based on what kind of leech it came from, but they now limit recovery from any leech based on what kind of recovery it is. This has no effect except in cases where one kind of leech applies a different kind of recovery. For example, Immortal Ambition makes life leech cause energy shield recovery instead of life recovery. Previously this was limited by {{c|mod|Maximum total Recovery per second from Life Leech}}. That recovery will now be limited by {{c|mod|Maximum total Energy Shield Recovery from Leech}}.{{sic}}
}}
